  "instance_name": "anti_semitism_nose_caricature",
  "label": "Anti-Semitic Nose Caricature Stereotype",
  "description": "A widely circulated antisemitic stereotype that caricatures Jewish people by emphasizing their nose, often implying inferiority or criminality. This stereotype is historically rooted in European antisemitism and is used to dehumanize and demean Jewish individuals. In this meme, Hitler’s prominent nose is implicitly referenced as part of the visual stereotype that has been used to mock or dehumanize him, even though the image itself does not contain any explicit antisemitic text or imagery.",
